    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm a bit confused by that. The meeting was scheduled in Conference Room B, which is under continuous security monitoring, and my principals were in the room from 8:55 AM until the end of the slot. There was no other CEO present in that space, and certainly no private conversation taking place. Can you help me reconcile your account with our security logs and the fact that the room was empty of Mr. Vane?",
